<view class="page home-page">
  <view class="connection-error" wx:if="{{connectionError}}" bindtap="refresh">{{connectionError}} · 点击重试</view>
  <view class="greeting"><view><view class="hello">你好，{{familyName}}</view><view class="date">{{todayLabel}} · 今天也记得问候家人</view></view><view class="sun">☀</view></view>
  <view class="home-story"><view class="story-copy"><view class="story-small">小小日常，满满牵挂</view><view class="story-title"><view>日子慢慢过，</view><view>关心一直在。</view></view><view class="story-sub">有空打个电话，听听家里的新鲜事。</view></view><image class="home-scene" src="/assets/home-scene.png" mode="widthFix" /></view>
  <view class="family-row"><view class="family-avatar">家</view><view class="family-copy"><view class="family-title">{{elder.homeTitle}}</view><view class="family-sub">{{elder.name}} · {{elder.relation}} · {{deviceLabel}}</view></view><view class="family-link" bindtap="goProfile">档案 ›</view></view>
  <button class="primary-btn home-cta" bindtap="goPillbox">看看家里的药盒　→</button>
  <view class="gentle-note">♡ 记录一次开盒，留住一份牵挂。开盒不等于服药。</view>
</view>
